      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَغِيثٌ</span></b>  <i>Wheat</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِنْطَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَعَامٌ</span> [both of which
